# Silence known, harmless warnings for everyday use (`make sim`).
# `make sim-debug` skips this file and shows everything.

# Unmodelled registers (FLASH, ADC...): thousands of accesses at boot.
logLevel 3 sysbus
# The ADC keeps converting while the firmware has DMA channel 1 disabled
# between two rounds of the multiplexer scan: those requests are dropped.
logLevel 3 dma1
